edia/images/dw/20260625/1146779427913732096186954.jpeg/Qqw4pYdKBQGgPU4huJeoCaECnV90omcbkn9bRpJ_W0Y\"/><figcaption>川井める（IG@meru___chu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川井める（IG@meru___chu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146779423257792512687092.jpeg/2a6WwJLmf26YLY14VnwgqEhEjgvzxjA4jYFf042BX9M\"/><figcaption>川井める（IG@meru___chu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"川井める（IG@meru___chu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146779420430700544738502.jpeg/H4FT3Zg0aQmIQzEcz43LzdL8bilSXnXW_cA_Lv3APy4\"/><figcaption>川井める（IG@meru___chu）</figcaption></figure><p>《教場》被當新生代演員跳板　木村拓哉霸氣開轟：片場不是養殖場！</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-01T13:20:09.202902+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3177,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}